# fdfpv-monitor.service: the off-box monitor of the live game and the VM,
# on the owner's DESKTOP (a systemd --user unit there, not on the VM). Runs
# monitor.sh as installed by README.md "Monitoring". Run by
# fdfpv-monitor.timer.
#
# CURL_HOME pins every curl to IPv4: ntfy.sh's free quota is per source
# address, and another device on this LAN spends the IPv6 /64's.
#
# Measured 2026-10-08 through this unit: 5.3 s wall clock, 1.1 s of CPU,
# 21 MB memory peak a run; no ceiling set at that size.
